                        <li><strong>Blockchain:</strong> smart contracts, tokenizzazione, DeFi, Web3</li>
                        <li><strong>Cybersecurity:</strong> penetration testing, vulnerability assessment, SOC, compliance</li>
                        <li><strong>Sviluppo Applicazioni Web:</strong> Spring Boot, React, PostgreSQL, architetture moderne</li>
